[0.017694, "o", "\r\n$ sigma listen --json\r\nWaiting for /ok from the demo phone...\r\n"]
[22.254135, "o", "\r\nReceived chat hook event: {\"command\": \"/ok\", \"args\": \"\", \"incoming_message_id\": 20}\r\n"]
[24.286177, "o", "\r\n$ opencode run --continue --model opencode/glm-5.3-flash-free \"Follow the /ok feedback\"\r\n"]
[27.432937, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n> build · glm-5.3-flash-free\r\n"]
[29.449401, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mpython3 - <<'EOF'\r\nimport subprocess, os\r\np = subprocess.run(\r\n    [\"sigma\", \"send-message\", \"me\", \"Approved — Orbit Desk is ready.\", \"--json\", \"--timeout\", \"120\"],\r\n    capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=200\r\n)\r\nos.makedirs(\"/home/demo/work/.private\", exist_ok=True)\r\nwith open(\"/home/demo/work/.private/send-message-approval.log\", \"w\") as f:\r\n    f.write(\"exit: %d\\n--- stdout ---\\n%s\\n--- stderr ---\\n%s\\n\" % (p.returncode, p.stdout, p.stderr))\r\nprint(\"exit:\", p.returncode)\r\nEOF\r\nexit: 0\r\n"]
[30.568352, "o", "> build · glm-5.3-flash-free\r\n"]
[33.027216, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mpython3 - <<'EOF'\r\nimport json\r\nout = open(\"/home/demo/work/.private/send-message-approval.log\").read()\r\nbody = out.split(\"--- stdout ---\")[1].split(\"--- stderr ---\")[0]\r\nrecs = [json.loads(l) for l in body.strip().splitlines() if l.startswith(\"{\")]\r\nr = recs[-1]\r\nprint(\"records:\", len(recs), \"| type:\", r.get(\"type\"), \"| command:\", r.get(\"command\"))\r\nids = {k: r[k] for k in (\"contact_id\", \"chat_id\", \"message_id\") if k in r}\r\nprint(json.dumps(ids))\r\nif r.get(\"type\") == \"sent\" and \"message_id\" in r and \"chat_id\" in r:\r\n    result = {\r\n        \"app\": \"Orbit Desk\",\r\n        \"alias\": \"me\",\r\n        \"contact_id\": 10,\r\n        \"chat_id\": r[\"chat_id\"],\r\n        \"message_id\": r[\"message_id\"],\r\n        \"message\": \"Approved — Orbit Desk is ready.\",\r\n        \"status\": \"sent\"\r\n    }\r\n    with open(\"/home/demo/work/result-approval.json\", \"w\") as f:\r\n        json.dump(result, f, indent=2)\r\n        f.write(\"\\n\")\r\n    print(\"result-approval.json written\")\r\nelse:\r\n    print(\"UNEXPECTED RESULT - result-approval.json NOT written\")\r\nEOF\r\nrecords: 1 | type: sent | command: send-message\r\n{\"chat_id\": 10, \"message_id\": 22}\r\nresult-approval.json written\r\n"]
[34.608298, "o", "> build · glm-5.3-flash-free\r\n"]
[34.62598, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mcat /home/demo/work/result-approval.json\r\n{\r\n  \"app\": \"Orbit Desk\",\r\n  \"alias\": \"me\",\r\n  \"contact_id\": 10,\r\n  \"chat_id\": 10,\r\n  \"message_id\": 22,\r\n  \"message\": \"Approved \\u2014 Orbit Desk is ready.\",\r\n  \"status\": \"sent\"\r\n}\r\n"]
[36.138316, "o", "> build · glm-5.3-flash-free\r\n"]
[38.355375, "o", "Done — stopping here.\r\n\r\n## Confirmation sent\r\n- Used the existing connected account and alias `me` — no `init`, no reconnection.\r\n- Sent **exactly one text message**: \"Approved — Orbit Desk is ready.\" via `sigma send-message me --json`.\r\n- Core accepted it with `type: sent`. Raw output captured to `.private/send-message-approval.log`; no credentials or `invite.txt` contents printed anywhere.\r\n- No other apps, files, or messages were sent.\r\n\r\n## `result-approval.json`\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"app\": \"Orbit Desk\",\r\n  \"alias\": \"me\",\r\n  \"contact_id\": 10,\r\n  \"chat_id\": 10,\r\n  \"message_id\": 22,\r\n  \"message\": \"Approved — Orbit Desk is ready.\",\r\n  \"status\": \"sent\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\nNew message ID **22** in chat 10 (revised app was message 19). As before, `type: sent` reflects the bot's submission through the mail server — delivery to your Delta Chat client is handled by the chatmail relay.\r\n"]
[38.407835, "o", "\r\nFeedback loop completed.\r\n"]
